d="n55" value="Optional DR plan / disabled by default&lt;br&gt;enable_dr_plan=false; type defaults SWITCHOVER&lt;br&gt;Plan belongs to standby DRPG; groups must be enabled." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;arcSize=10;dashed=1;fillColor=#FCFBFA;strokeColor=#9E9892;fontColor=#161513;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="n30"><mxGeometry x="30.00" y="590.00" width="1100.00" height="115.00" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n57" value="DEFAULT RESOURCE SHAPE: 2 DR protection groups + 2 regional log buckets, once required region/provider inputs are supplied.&lt;br&gt;Member lists are empty and DR plan creation is disabled. Plan creation does not execute switchover/failover or configure workload replication.&lt;br&gt;No RTO/RPO or recoverability outcome is validated. Primary/standby placement is an input, not an approved live test scope." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#FCFBFA;strokeColor=#9E9892;fontColor=#312D2A;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20.00" y="1100.00" width="2460.00" height="135.00" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n58" value="Source review: 2026-10-28. No cloud provisioning, provider revalidation, compliance certification, packet test or recovery drill.&lt;br&gt;Placement values are source defaults or marked operator inputs. Arrows are configuration relationships / stated route intent, not verified runtime behavior." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#312D2A;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20.00" y="1270.00" width="2460.00" height="65.00" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n27" value="log_location reference" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;startFill=0;rounded=0;endSize=6;startSize=6;strokeColor=#312D2A;fontSize=10;fontColor=#312D2A;labelB